@startuml
title Create Payment - Sequence Diagram

actor "Merchant System" as Merchant
participant "Payment API" as API
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "Rate Limiter" as RL
participant "Idempotency Store" as Idem
participant "Merchant Config Service" as Config
participant "Payment Service" as PaymentSvc
database "Payment DB" as DB
queue "Outbox / Event Bus" as EventBus

Merchant -> API: POST /payments
API -> Auth: Authenticate Merchant
Auth --> API: Auth OK

API -> RL: Check rate limit
RL --> API: Allowed

API -> Idem: Check idempotency key

alt Duplicate request (same payload)
    Idem --> API: Return existing response
    API --> Merchant: 200 OK
else Conflict (same key, different payload)
    Idem --> API: Conflict
    API --> Merchant: 409 Conflict
else New request
    API -> Config: Load merchant config
    Config --> API: Config data

    API -> PaymentSvc: Create Payment

    PaymentSvc -> DB: Begin transaction
    PaymentSvc -> DB: Insert Payment
    PaymentSvc -> DB: Insert Idempotency record
    PaymentSvc -> DB: Commit

    PaymentSvc -> EventBus: Publish PaymentCreated

    API --> Merchant: 201 Created
end

@enduml